---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan">
  <Navigation />
  
  <main class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center py-20 px-4">
 <div class="text-center max-w-2xl">
 <div class="mb-10">
 <div class="text-[150px] md:text-[200px] leading-none font-black gradient-text text-shadow-lg">404</div>
 </div>
 
 <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black mb-5 text-shadow">
 Halaman Tidak Ditemukan
 </h1>
 
 <p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-10 font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-lg mx-auto">
 Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari tidak ditemukan. Mungkin halaman telah dipindahkan atau dihapus.
 </p>
 
 <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 justify-center">
 <a href="/" class="btn-accent text-lg">
 <span class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
 <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
 <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path>
 </svg>
 Kembali ke Beranda
 </span>
 </a>
 <a href="/mobil-tersedia" class="btn-outline text-lg">
 Lihat Mobil Tersedia
 </a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </main>
 
 <Footer />
</Layout>
